00:41:33,488 --> 00:41:34,847
And so we need to scope it down.

921
00:41:34,847 --> 00:41:37,047
We need to start off with a smaller task

922
00:41:37,048 --> 00:41:38,967
that, okay, I can definitely do this thing.

923
00:41:38,967 --> 00:41:40,408
I can definitely work on this goal.

924
00:41:40,408 --> 00:41:41,807
And sometimes that comes automatically.

