00:41:57,847 --> 00:41:58,688
I can do that thing

935
00:41:58,688 --> 00:41:59,728
and then you can do the next thing

936
00:41:59,728 --> 00:42:00,927
and the next thing and the next thing.

937
00:42:00,927 --> 00:42:04,128
And so I think those two attitudes that work,

938
00:42:04,128 --> 00:42:06,648
especially important work often is difficult

939
00:42:06,648 --> 00:42:08,807
and asking what's next are two ways

